Package: MiCARA
Title: Microbiome Confounder-Adjusted Robust Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Safa", "Bushnaq", , "19397747@brookes.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment=c(ORCID="0009-0000-3723-5725"))
Description: Provides a robust dual-layer framework for identifying and
    visualizing disease-associated taxonomic and functional interaction
    networks from heterogeneous microbiome cohorts. MiCARA combines
    compositional data transformation, mixed-effects differential
    abundance analysis, confounder adjustment, residual correlation
    analysis, and multiple-testing correction to characterize
    taxonomic-functional associations and represent them as Sankey
    networks.
